---
import founderImage from "/public/images/About-us.jpg";
---
<section class="bg-white py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-12">
    <!-- Top Section -->
    <div class="grid items-center gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <!-- Left Image -->
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] shadow-xl group">
        <img
          src={founderImage.src}
          alt="Mr. B.K. Kiran"
          class="h-[500px] w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/5 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-transparent"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Content -->
      <div>
        <span class="font-sans text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-[#B02317]">
          Leadership
        </span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl font-medium leading-tight text-[#121417]">
          Building Trust Through <br />
          <span class="text-[#B02317] italic">Quality & Commitment</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#88726F]">
          <p>
            Udbhav Developers is a founder-led boutique real estate firm specializing in premium residential and commercial developments in prime locations. Guided by engineering discipline, transparent practices, and a long-term value mindset.
          </p>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-[#B02317] pl-6 bg-slate-50/50 py-4 pr-4 rounded-r-lg">
            <p>
              Led by <strong class="text-[#121417]">Mr. B.K. Kiran</strong>, a qualified civil engineer with over two decades of international and domestic experience, Udbhav Developers follows a focused, quality-first approach.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Content -->
    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#88726F]">
      <p>
        Mr. Kiran remains closely involved in every stage of development, from land evaluation and feasibility studies to design coordination, construction supervision, and final delivery. His engineering background ensures disciplined planning, cost control, structural integrity, and adherence to timelines.
      </p>
      <p>
        Rather than pursuing aggressive expansion, Udbhav Developers has adopted a focused growth strategy. By limiting the number of projects undertaken at any given time, the firm ensures that every development receives full attention, resulting in superior design resolution, consistent quality, and dependable delivery.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>